@startuml
title Plugin Invocation Flow
hide footbox

participant "Caller" as Caller
participant "Engine Dispatch" as Dispatch
participant "Runtime Registries" as State
participant "Plugin Handler" as Handler

Caller -> Dispatch : Invoke a model handler
Dispatch -> State : Resolve loaded model and its plugin handler
State --> Dispatch : Handler definition
Dispatch -> Dispatch : Validate inputs and begin caller-scoped request
Dispatch -> Handler : Execute with request context
Handler --> Dispatch : Result or stream events
Dispatch --> Caller : Validated output
@enduml
